<title>SWEDEN: Industrivarden H1 profit up sharply.</title>
<headline>Industrivarden H1 profit up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30,</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		 1,188  vs    620</p>
<p> Net asset value		     **18,300  vs    n/a</p>
<p> Net asset value/share (crowns)     **382  vs    377</p>
<p> Turnover				   2,713  vs  7,258</p>
<p> Operating costs			  2,452  vs  6,299</p>
<p> Depreciation				 103  vs    402</p>
<p> Operating profit			   158  vs    557</p>
<p> Dividend income on share portfolio   490  vs    254</p>
<p> Profit from share sales		  620  vs     13</p>
<p> Net financial items		CHARGE 80  vs    204 CHARGE</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			   1,157  vs    592</p>
<p> Tax					     46  vs    118</p>
<p> Net result				 1,111  vs    474</p>
<p>NOTE -- AB Industrivarden is a Swedish-based investment company.</p>
<p>** 1996 H1 net asset value is established on August 28. Asset value per share was established on June 30.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
